    "Is it allowed for a marshaling station to be \"used\" (incurring its fixed cost) while its total transshipped flow is zero, or must a station's fixed cost be incurred only if its total flow is strictly positive (so a station with zero flow is simply not used and incurs no cost)?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy decision regarding the relationship between fixed cost incurrence and flow volume, presenting two mutually exclusive options for one specific rule."
}

